		<!-- Content -->
		<div class="container"><h1>Delete a Receipt</h1>
<p>Remove a receipt you no longer want to keep.</p>

<h3>Steps</h3>
<ol>
	<li>In the <strong>Receipt List</strong>, click the receipt you want to remove so it is highlighted.</li>
	<li>Click <strong>Delete</strong>.</li>
	<li>The receipt is removed from the list, and the receipt count at the bottom goes down. In this example, Staples was deleted, leaving 2 receipts.</li>
</ol>
<img src="/images/delete-result.png" width="100%" alt="Receipt List after deleting Staples">

<p>If you click <strong>Delete</strong> without selecting a receipt, the message "Select a receipt to delete." appears.</p>
<p>Next: <a href="/summary">view the spending summary</a>.</p>
